      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKYDREAM (7) has been costly over the journey, none more so than last start when beaten at $1.40 in an easier race than this, but the start prior - when a dazzling maiden winner - emphasised the talent she has. Get the feeling her best is the best of anything in this race, and if she shows it, they'll struggle to beat her. GRANDPA NEIL (5) registered his first win when resuming last start over 1400m at Warrnambool, getting home by a nose. Is lightly raced and has plenty of scope for improvement and might have come back better this time in. POSITIVO (3) backed up some good performances to start the campaign with a nice win last start and draws to go on with it here. Conversely, LYON STREET LUIGI (2) draws out but has been working up to something this prep and strikes the right race to peak.",
